{"id":754,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div><div><p>3月17日下午，体育学院学生党员之家举办“青春心向党 劳动显担当”主题党日活动，全体“党员先锋岗”学生共同参与，聚焦学院办公区域与楼宇环境清洁，以实干美化家园。</p><p>活动中，全体人员分组行动，对体育学院楼的自习室、实验室、办公室、会议室、楼内公共区域开展全面清洁。大家各司其职，清扫地面、擦拭门窗扶手、规整公共物品，清理角落积尘与杂物，学院楼面貌迅速焕然一新。</p><p>此次活动精准聚焦学院环境建设，既优化了办公学习环境，更强化了党员的服务意识与集体凝聚力，为学院后续党建与学风建设注入实干力量。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PM7-YsMlCYolV2U4zMkLNLbMzGYnlU8bM8lZM8U4nzM7L7l0gihFp2hmCIa0LSyPLSyYn1hVUN-YUzTRMmf7n7WRMzLsUl7PMm-8UllsnzrFoz7sL7r2nRrFLNU8M8UJv2bjo4Oeosnb_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUDg47iM4-sgtA8pUicc&oid=1054562613&tid=1046&nid=15727&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/1112FEBB2A9C60DDBC537AA1624AE7E5/9170EFD5/2D47D\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"690\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PLRMYVoRCDUmCiU4mNaL8-Dn7CPnmU8bnm9Poz78oRWfLmL0gihFp2hmCIa0LkyPU1yYUSh7o7Vfo778LmrkL49YMmTVo7UYMm94LmW2nlrFLNCPnNlaUNnFoR-aMRCJv2bjo4Oeosnb_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUDg47iM4-sgtA8pUicc&oid=1054562613&tid=1046&nid=15727&e=.png\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PnzMYknlVRnRf2L4m-DMmW7MmTfUz-8aoln2MzGiL7CZozU0gihFp2hmCIa0LYh2MShRMYhVL77aUzWRLmC4UlUaL4T7U4nRUmCinzfRU4VFozfVnmG8LNMFLNnkL4-Jqjfjo4Oeosnb_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUDg47iM4-sgtA8pUicc&oid=1054562613&tid=1046&nid=15727&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/3F5C7E0A0A2C263AD039DC4CB65E0CC1/90EF042C/2DB32\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PUzMY2MN-8Mm-io4z7DnmMfM87PMz68VMlUPUlCaMRV2Mm70gihFp2hmCIa0n1ybL1yinkhfMN-PnmWkozlZMm-ZU4GbM7QfLlLaMz-YUzVFU4nfL4vbM8MFUm6fUz9Jqjfjo4Oeosnb_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUDg47iM4-sgtA8pUicc&oid=1054562613&tid=1046&nid=15727&e=.jpg\"></p><p><br></p><p><br></p></div></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://tyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PM7-YsMlCYolV2U4zMkLNLbMzGYnlU8bM8lZM8U4nzM7L7l0gihFp2hmCIa0LSyPLSyYn1hVUN-YUzTRMmf7n7WRMzLsUl7PMm-8UllsnzrFoz7sL7r2nRrFLNU8M8UJv2bjo4Oeosnb_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUDg47iM4-sgtA8pUicc&oid=1054562613&tid=1046&nid=15727&e=.png"}